# kin/child/head/ears_half: the half-breed child's ears: the human ear with a 1 px tip up, over the hair
# The child's half-breed ears (KIN-CHILD). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role ears half
layer ears
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin 1 -4
